@MidnightNtwrk and the @midnightfdn thank you all for a wonderful event and workshops!

Singapore as a destination:
The city was quite clean, besides the super bad air quality like what the hell man? LOL.
However for me the city is totally over price for a Asian city and that took away some of the joy in my opinion. If we can unlock China as a open Crypto country it can show other Asian countries what is up...

The Future Plans:
I am more motivated now than I was before the event. One thing was clear from the many many talks is that we need to collaborate more on ideas and problems that needs solving.

Builders are the future and we have to embrace and push them forward!

The barrier to entry is getting lower and lower as we go.

